OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F405A1785331108
OL,3,CBoy, 5, seriously injured after bus
OL,4,Ccrashes into house
OL,6,FA child has been seriously injured
OL,7,Fafter a double-decker bus crashed into
OL,8,Fa house in Devon.
OL,10,FThe crash happened on Torquay Road, in
OL,11,FShaldon, at around 6:45pm on Monday 27
OL,12,FJuly.
OL,14,FDevon and Cornwall Police said a five-
OL,15,Fyear-old boy, from Torquay, who was a
OL,16,Fpassenger on the bus, was seriously
OL,17,Finjured and was taken to Bristol
OL,18,FChildren's Hospital.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/4
