OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F405A1785331108
OL,3,CBoy, 5, seriously injured after bus
OL,4,Ccrashes into house
OL,6,FA man in his 60s, from Torbay, has
OL,7,Fbeen arrested on suspicion of causing
OL,8,Fserious injury by careless driving,
OL,9,Fthe force said. He remains in police
OL,10,Fcustody while enquiries are ongoing.
OL,12,FPolice said ambulance crews assessed
OL,13,F14 other passengers at the scene.
OL,15,FSubscribe free to our weekly
