OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F405A1785331108
OL,3,CBoy, 5, seriously injured after bus
OL,4,Ccrashes into house
OL,6,FThe road was closed for around seven
OL,7,Fhours while police investigated, and
OL,8,Fthe bus was recovered.
OL,10,FA spokesperson for Devon and Cornwall
OL,11,FPolice said: "Officers are appealing
OL,12,Ffor information and footage after a
OL,13,Fchild was seriously injured in a
OL,14,Fcollision involving a bus in Shaldon,
OL,15,FDevon.
OL,17,F"They are keen to hear from anyone who
OL,18,Fmay have relevant CCTV, doorbell,
OL,19,Fmobile phone or dashcam footage.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/4
